# Claude Code config is NOT managed in this repo.
# Skills live in claude-skills-private (installed as plugins / symlinked);
# core config is handled by the migrate-ai-config skill. Never stow a claude package.
^claude$

# Claude Desktop rewrites this file at runtime: starred sessions, sidebar mode,
# account UUIDs, device name. Symlinking it would keep the repo permanently
# dirty, and an atomic-rename save would replace the symlink with a real file
# anyway. mac-migration-old-machine.sh still copies it here as a backup; it is
# just never stowed.
claude_desktop_config\.json

# Automator reads a .workflow as a bundle and crashes with
# "NSFileWrapper regularFileContents" when it finds symlinks INSIDE one, which
# is exactly what `stow --no-folding` produces. A symlink to the whole bundle
# directory works fine, so the migration script links these explicitly.
^Services$
